  "text_pages": [
    "Organise your stay - Bordeaux Montaigne University v1.2\nGo to content\nGo to search\nGo to menu\nOrganise your stay - Bordeaux Montaigne University v1.2\nShare\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nSend by Mail\nYour name\n*\nYour mail\n*\nRecipient(s)\n*\nSeparated by coma\nMessage\nImage's text\n*\nIf the image is not clear enough, you can refresh the page.\nOrganise your stay\nIf you are reading these pages it means that you are getting ready to join us at Bordeaux Montaigne University for a term or the whole academic year and this fills us with pleasure and pride! To give a\nquality welcome to international students\nis one of\nInternational Relations Office priorities\n.\nAs international students, you come here with different origins, cultures and points of view. This international setting in immersion with our native French students is the perfect place for your studies and to realize the many benefits of international mobility activities.\nYour stay also benefits us, by enriching our community. When you come to our establishment, you share your experiences, participate in the local student life and represent your country and home university abroad.\nThe International Relations Office team wishes you an\nexcellent stay at Bordeaux Montaigne University\n!\nfooter-script"
  ],
